    "created_at": "2016-01-26T08:07:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-26T08:07:10Z",
    "body": "It seems to me that this is currently a UI decision when to set it and what to set it to (the spec only _unsets_ it). Is there a reason this needs to be interoperable, or should it be left as UI decision?\n\nHave you filed a bug for Chrome?\n",
